                    <signifLet xml:id="m-b3e0d2b9-9a70-4d23-bec8-3595b122ecbf" /></nc><nc xml:id="m-081de5c2-3bc1-4f5e-92da-20cbe130346c" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-ea0eee86-7830-47f3-aaab-3d0d7d0f0512" facs="#m-0b8243d8-37fc-469d-913f-ed7ffc3ec6c0" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-ab0033d4-f455-4e1e-b849-1ba8c6ee592d"><lg xml:id="m-d2915fcc-b6ac-4691-8243-4169461ad6fb"><l xml:id="m-9a0972d6-bf3d-4ecf-924a-e64cd7e59715" facs="#m-83129d27-db9e-4069-8743-6cdc32e3eabc" label="ambiguous">1627</l><l xml:id="m-4103b7f8-3062-4c96-b7d2-60333770c114" facs="#m-8e4dd07d-5bc2-4861-830d-82508f548e14" label="ambiguous">September 9</l><l xml:id="m-f8398b6c-1e01-4bcc-9f35-450571151e4f" facs="#m-39459156-566b-4505-bfa2-05cf7200e51b" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Ab inítio. Hymn. Ave máris stélla. p. 1259.</l><l xml:id="m-5decd54a-8bc3-46dc-b023-9df11c182f29" facs="#m-f3d43d7d-f362-4c4c-86f3-f1f4d0c43501" label="lyrics-like">V. Natívitas est hódie sánctae Mariae Virginis.</l><l xml:id="m-10faf66b-154e-42ef-9312-18bced9641f1" facs="#m-bece7adb-23f1-4602-b5d9-ab7f34ec5225" label="lyrics-like">R. Cújus víta inclyta cúnctas illústrat ecclésias.</l><l xml:id="m-60d73d50-a985-4539-8461-8c88e1fa3dc4" facs="#m-ab0fd2d2-58cb-46f9-a0bf-19e7a8aa2e19" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-864c78a7-2146-438c-bc1c-2ba94c67763b" facs="#m-d1749286-ee60-401d-9895-d4c23e10c65b" label="ambiguous">Ant. I.i</l><l xml:id="m-c5a96bba-11bc-41d0-8e26-0e4819c2df26" facs="#m-18e6c646-b4e6-44c1-87d6-843f937806cd" label="ambiguous">n</l><l xml:id="m-a706280f-e16f-43e7-b80a-423214fef73d" facs="#m-15b13fa4-3dd7-46e8-b7fa-1a97e281e391" label="lyrics-like">Atí-vi-tas tú-a, “Dé-i Génitrix Virgo, gáu¬</l><l xml:id="m-00e9ceeb-3ecb-4411-866b-20633cd0cf15" facs="#m-22481316-8121-41a8-bdba-6c65ccc4bd48" label="lyrics-like">di-um annunti-ávit univérso múndo: ex te enim</l><l xml:id="m-39c2ffb2-5f79-4167-867c-2a3122cfb1c3" facs="#m-ad7b2dd5-c12b-40e0-8bff-f00b50b409a0" label="lyrics-like">órtus est Sol justí-ti-ae, Chrístus Dé-us nóster: qui</l><l xml:id="m-da10fde0-3967-4fd7-b28c-5c67cc055948" facs="#m-1ca21c2f-5426-43c9-b741-07a43600aeb1" label="lyrics-like">sólvens ma-le dicti-ónem, dédit benedicti-nem: et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7a306f7-0abd-41a0-ac86-822349a17eb0" facs="#m-3c0203e8-6d95-4cf2-89ae-ba95edf0e0d7" label="lyrics-like">ví-tam sempi-tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4bb065d-aa82-4550-a981-0d7573ab43b9" facs="#m-a0f832f6-0ed5-4828-9519-e11f00d234cd" label="lyrics-like">fúndens mórtem, do- návit nó-bis</l><l xml:id="m-b6595571-8b6c-4f1c-ada2-291bb589561d" facs="#m-e432e345-cc84-42eb-8858-ee38d4280150" label="ambiguous">nam. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-21041d38-4afb-48f1-992c-bd9346ca5bbb" facs="#m-d6b8fb1b-6369-4994-84d4-2e58468d6b76" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 1. f. p. 207. or p. 213. — Prayer. Fámulis tuis. n.1624.</l><l xml:id="m-7e8b4e67-dfbe-4d1e-bcc6-11bd7d091906" facs="#m-ae4c25f9-2265-4653-8e89-b1a68ec19be9" label="ambiguous">S. Gorgonius, Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-f1d91f2e-8d5c-4952-923d-1eb714a2ba4f" facs="#m-3c8e8fbf-60f5-4168-808d-26ae02440b32" label="ambiguous">Simple.</l><l xml:id="m-440a3cfe-0c62-40e0-951c-6b8edb20e1ab" facs="#m-89eb91a5-b893-4f45-adce-1e288c2f1c06" label="ambiguous">9.</l><l xml:id="m-e438ce22-63c7-42c4-8c1c-8cd4b3d1e9de" facs="#m-2c0835db-5f22-4200-8a54-11b5e5411c62" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Laetábitur. p. 1138.</l><l xml:id="m-9f23df26-c98c-4cdb-828a-a2031484b202" facs="#m-3303c0e9-a491-422a-918b-c7abfaea94b8" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-0facb01b-0c44-4600-91c1-1aa8f8cb1f46" facs="#m-28dc1816-2c95-42aa-b4a0-297b240ebf95" label="lyrics-like">NAnctus tuus, Dómine, Gorgónius! et pia fáciat solemnitáte gaudére</l><l xml:id="m-fe3d1ac1-d7b3-498c-bad7-817a95c82d70" facs="#m-f55d1b3d-3439-42dc-a4ef-366f9850e633" label="lyrics-like">O sua nos intercessióne laetificet:*l Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-43ad1408-3d42-4252-af2a-2dcdfd30f74a" facs="#m-97074d5b-5deb-4b20-ba94-7c6473576b1a" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-060c550b-6666-474f-a82b-e7a318cdeb3e" facs="#m-4f5b7a76-a896-41c4-8ae1-c920ca2116e0" label="lyrics-like">(Rata tibi sit, Dómine, nostrae! ctus Gorgónius Martyr intervéntor</l><l xml:id="m-1243162c-7927-4433-8b23-f90bbd6da99c" facs="#m-f645276f-370a-4bbf-b92d-6613d7da1dd6" label="lyrics-like">(Y servitútis oblátio: pro qua san-exsístat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9e9eee92-885b-495f-91d2-067d37ace990" facs="#m-f684ca24-1e3c-4577-9325-23ad856704a1" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-4aed79d9-79f5-4640-89bf-cb3e1ca0a05b" facs="#m-52397f4d-25dd-43d1-a2fe-339186616fdf" label="lyrics-like">LAmiliam tuam, Deus, suávitas] sti Filii tui bono júgiter odóre pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a3f138f-c96f-4dcc-88c3-22bfec111cd5" facs="#m-cc82a6cb-5c03-4474-9535-b642c9d3bfef" label="lyrics-like">scátur: Qui tecum.</l><l xml:id="m-104224a7-ea12-4941-9762-9b7b8f9801dd" facs="#m-79fd4f5f-21fa-4dcd-8413-b4115b72f3e9" label="lyrics-like">aetérna contíngat et végetet:</l><l xml:id="m-c730547f-cf8f-44c7-8fdb-9fcc927f7b91" facs="#m-2f7b510a-14d0-435d-95a8-fd64e1d71ad3" label="lyrics-like">quae in Mártyre tuo Gorgóniõ Chri¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
